	(text "SSD1677 application circuit captured as discretes. R0.1 now follows the current 3.97-inch panel reference: 10uH + NMOS + 3x MBR0530 + 2.2R RESE + 1M GDR pulldown + local 4.7uF input capacitor." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "72000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000172"))
	(text "D1: SW -> VGH. C3 flying capacitor + D2/D3 form the negative VGL pump. Q_EPD source is sensed at RESE through 2.2R to GND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 25 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "72000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000173"))
	(text "VPP is explicitly left NC for normal operation; BS1 is tied LOW for 4-wire SPI. Current panel pins 6/7 remain NC pending panel-specific continuity confirmation." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "72000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000174"))
	(text "R0.1 requires first-board scope validation of VGH/VGL/VSH/VSL/VCOM. TYS5040100M-10 and TYS5040470M-10 share the same TYS5040 land pattern, so 47uH remains a laboratory alternate without PCB respin." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 35 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "72000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000175"))
